# Caches the game writes next to levels (the bots' navigation grids).
navgrid_*.bin

# A mod imported from a BF2 mod (bf2-import ... --out mods/<name> ...) is derived from EA's
# and the BF2 mod author's copyrighted data, exactly like /imported/: never commit it. Add a
# line here for every such mod folder (unlike mods/sample, which is hand-authored and safe to
# share, so it isn't listed).
/aix2/
